# engine.api - the symbols a code table may ask the engine for (docs/ENGINE_API.md).
#
#   engine <major>.<minor>
#   <tier> <mangled symbol> <module>
#
# A: offered, frozen - a change to one of these is a deliberate act and bumps the engine version.
# B: offered, and expected to change with the renderer, the network and the loading machinery.
# Anything else the engine's own namespaces contain is refused at load time, with the symbol named.
# The platform (libc, libstdc++, Vulkan, GLFW) is not part of this list and never checked.
#
# Generated from the symbols the game's own table asks the host for (codetab dump), which is the
# measured floor of the surface: what the game itself needs, a mod needs a subset of.

